<title>PERU: Telefonica del Peru Q4 net rises.</title>
<headline>Telefonica del Peru Q4 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>LIMA 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q4 1996			Q4 1995</p>
<p>Net		  289.1 million soles vs 227.3 million soles</p>
<p>Net per shr	  0.124 sol	   vs   0.097 sol</p>
<p>Net per ADS	 $0.477		 vs  $0.373</p>
<p>Revs		 879.2 million soles vs 663.1 million soles</p>
<p>			  YEAR 1996		  YEAR 1995</p>
<p>Net		  902.1 million soles vs 784.7 million soles</p>
<p>Net per shr	  0.386 sol	   vs   0.336 sol</p>
<p>Net per ADS	 $1.485		 vs  $1.292</p>
<p>Revs		   3.130 bln soles   vs   2.666 bln soles</p>
<p>NOTES: Telefonica del Peru, the Lima Stock Exchange's benchmark company, is majority-owned by Spain's Telefonica de Espana.</p>
<p>((-- Saul Hudson, Lima newsroom, 511 221-2134))</p>
</text>
